💎 GIWA Alpha Watchlist

🔔  @GIWA_by_Upbit is an Ethereum L2 launched by Upbit and operated by Dunamu

GIWA has been in the testnet phase for a year now and seems to be preparing for its mainnet launch

List of early projects 👇

🔷 Launchpads

@GiwaGasok: Launchpad focused on fair token launches
@Flutchdotfun: Infrastructure for launching and managing tokens
@deuslaunch: Launchpad for day-one token launches
@cookhousememe: Meme coin launchpad for the GIWA ecosystem
@Kajadotfun: Launchpad with verified launches and holder-focused features
@gamapadcom: Token launchpad (Testnet is live)

🔷 NFTs

@PunkOnGiwa: Punk-style NFT collection
@Gaejuki_Giwa: Meme project based on the popular Korean Gaejuki dog character
@GIWAUP: NFT collection of 2,222 Tilekeepers inspired by Korean culture
@Jumak_app: NFT launchpad with a tavern and degen theme
@Giwatron: On-chain protocol with NFT-related features
@elderwoodwiz: Story-driven fantasy NFT universe

🔷 DeFi | Other

@vigilanmarket: P2P hedging platform

⚡️ Early Projects Watchlist

🔷 Trading and Markets

@PeaksTrade: trading app for ideas, trends and tokens
@HyperPNL: onchain prop trading platform
@cabaldotcooking: private social trading on Robinhood Chain

🔷 Prediction Markets

@ParlayXOfficial: institutional infrastructure for prediction markets
@LiquidictionHL: frontend for Hyperliquid prediction markets
@swaydotfun: narrative market where ideas become positions

🔷 AI

@YAI_Protocol: decentralized AI compute network
@genesis_L1: L1 for scientific data and models
@CatalystLabsX: AI agents that turn ideas into automated trading strategies (raised $30M)
@priors_trade: credit layer for AI agents

🔷 Other

@BlockRips: social digital card packs on Solana
@neo_lyfe: photorealistic decentralized metaverse
@getonmoon: leveraged trading across crypto, stocks, futures and commodities
@Spiko_finance: tokenized cash funds
@routedotfun: swap aggregator for Robinhood Chain

